{"title": "Psychic Leech", "pageid": 28340, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Psychic_Leech", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Psychic Leech</b> is a passive feature that heals the wearer whenever an enemy succumbs to one of your spells targetting their mind.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When an enemy fails a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/38px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/50px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charisma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png/25px-Charisma_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Charisma_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/25px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/38px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/50px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Intelligence\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png/25px-Intelligence_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Intelligence_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/25px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/38px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/50px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png/25px-Wisdom_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Wisdom_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> against one of your spells or cantrips, you regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish\" title=\"Circlet of Mental Anguish\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Circlet_of_Mental_Anguish_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- 